@startuml page_state
!theme cyborg
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #0b1018
skinparam defaultFontColor #e6edf7
skinparam ArrowColor #a9b8ca
skinparam state {
 BackgroundColor #111826
 BorderColor #a9b8ca
}
title Setup page: browser-local view versus controller status
hide empty description

state "Browser view (portal.html)" as Browser {
 state "Interactive views" as Interactive {
  state "list\nnetworks, Rescan, Cancel setup" as List
  state "form\nselected network, password" as Form
  state "busy\nLoading, Scanning, Connecting" as Busy
  [*] --> Busy : page load / poll at once
  Busy --> List : poll: selecting or connect_failed;\nConnect not 2xx / rejection message
  List --> List : poll: list changed / redraw
  List --> Form : select network / Activity
  Form --> List : Back / Activity
  Form --> Form : poll: scanning, selecting,\nconnect_failed / form kept
  Form --> Busy : Connect / POST /connect;\npoll: connecting
  List --> Busy : Rescan / POST /rescan;\npoll: scanning or connecting
 }
 state "done\nresult, closed or no-answer guidance" as Done
 Interactive --> Done : poll: connected, save_failed, closing,\nunknown status or poll failure;\nCancel setup / POST /cancel
 Done --> Interactive : poll: selecting, connect_failed,\nscanning or connecting
}

state "Controller status (published by PORTAL and COMMUNICATION)" as Controller {
 state "selecting" as Selecting
 state "scanning" as Scanning
 state "connecting" as Connecting
 state "connect_failed\nselection stays ready" as ConnectFailed
 state "connected" as Connected
 state "save_failed" as SaveFailed
 state "closing" as Closing
 [*] --> Selecting : setup opens with the completed list
 Selecting --> Scanning : Rescan accepted
 ConnectFailed --> Scanning : Rescan accepted
 Scanning --> Selecting : scan completed
 Selecting --> Connecting : Connect accepted
 ConnectFailed --> Connecting : Connect accepted
 Connecting --> ConnectFailed : join failed / list refreshed
 Connecting --> Connected : joined and saved
 Connecting --> SaveFailed : joined, save failed
 Connected --> Closing : after 10 s result display
 SaveFailed --> Closing : after 10 s result display
 Selecting --> Closing : Cancel, inactivity
 ConnectFailed --> Closing : Cancel, inactivity,\nlist refresh failed
 Scanning --> Closing : scan failed
 Closing --> [*] : 2 s notice (Cancel, inactivity,\nscan failure), then teardown
}

Browser -[hidden]right-> Controller

legend bottom left
 Implemented at integration 994ce24 and matching the design unless stated. The page polls /status once per second, one poll outstanding.
 A poll failure also replaces an open form with guidance; the next successful poll (selecting, connect_failed) restores the list.
 Start from CONTROL publishes closing from any status without a notice delay. Accepting Connect, Rescan or Cancel sets
 connecting, scanning or closing at once, before COMMUNICATION reads the request; Activity keeps the status and cause.
 Known issue TICKET-223 / GitHub #158, not fixed: responses are applied in arrival order, so a stale poll or POST reply
 can replace a newer view (see the command and poll sequence).
endlegend
@enduml
